    skos:prefLabel "读不到批准记录时退回确认框测试"@zh ;
    skos:altLabel "Coverage unknown falls back to confirmation test"@en ;
    skos:definition "aisep-workbench 仓库 frontend/src/renderer/aisep/AisepGatePage.test.tsx 中 describe「repeat approval guard: coverage unknown」下的测试：读不到批准记录时批准与驳回经确认框后可点。"@zh .

