:acNoRepeatSameSelection a aisep:AcceptanceCriterion ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    skos:prefLabel "刷新或重进后不能重复批准已批准的同一选择"@zh ;
    skos:altLabel "An already approved selection cannot be approved again after a reload"@en ;
    aisep:gherkin "Given 分支上有 Approved 批准记录，且这些记录之后分支上没有内容改动（有效内容提交到分支顶端之间只有批准提交）；这段里关口为 G 的全部 Approved 记录已批元素的并集为 S（可以是多条记录，也不一定在分支顶端：之后可能又批过别的关口）\nWhen 刷新或重进该分支的关口页，关口选 G，勾选的元素都在 S 里\nThen 批准按钮不可点，也不给「再写一条记录」的确认框，批准区说明本分支已经批准过这一选择" .

:acOtherGateOrRejectAllowed a aisep:AcceptanceCriterion ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    skos:prefLabel "换关口、勾选新元素、驳回或内容改动后仍可操作"@zh ;
    skos:altLabel "Another gate, a new element, a rejection or new content can still be recorded"@en ;
    aisep:gherkin "Given 分支上有 Approved 批准记录，关口为 G 的这些记录已批元素的并集为 S\nWhen 关口换成 G 以外的关口，或勾选了 S 以外的元素，或选择驳回，或这些批准之后分支上又有内容改动\nThen 批准或驳回按钮不因已有批准而停用；页面提示已有批准时，勾选「我确认要在这个分支上再写一条记录」后按钮可点" .

:rel-reqApprovalProgress-aggregates-acNoRepeatSameSelection a am4:Aggregation ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    arch:source :reqApprovalProgress ;
    arch:target :acNoRepeatSameSelection .

:rel-reqApprovalProgress-aggregates-acOtherGateOrRejectAllowed a am4:Aggregation ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    arch:source :reqApprovalProgress ;
    arch:target :acOtherGateOrRejectAllowed .

:rel-tcRepeatApprovalSameSelection-verifies-acNoRepeatSameSelection a aisep:Verification ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    arch:source :tcRepeatApprovalSameSelection ;
    arch:target :acNoRepeatSameSelection .

:rel-tcRepeatApprovalOtherGateOrReject-verifies-acOtherGateOrRejectAllowed a aisep:Verification ;
    arch:inModel <https://aisep.example/model/workbench/> ;
    arch:source :tcRepeatApprovalOtherGateOrReject ;
    arch:target :acOtherGateOrRejectAllowed .

